<article class="prose">
<h1>About Bluebonnet Rentals</h1>
<p><strong>Bluebonnet Rentals is not a real business.</strong> It is a fictional listings site built for the Spigot demo, so Spigot never has to crawl or name a real company.</p>
<p>The <%= num(counts.listings) %> listings, <%= num(counts.agents) %> agents and <%= counts.openHouses %> open houses are generated from a fixed random seed. Neighbourhood names are real Austin-area places; every brokerage, person, phone number (555-01xx) and email address (example.com) is invented.</p>
</article>
